<title>HONG KONG: Firstone says in asset disposal talks.</title>
<headline>Firstone says in asset disposal talks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstone International Holdings Ltd said on Monday it was in discussions on the possible sale of an asset.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is currently in preliminary discussions in relation to a possible disposal of (an) asset by the company,&quot; the capacitors maker said in the statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Further details regarding the proposed transaction will be announced by the company, if necessary, as and when appropriate.&quot;</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>Firstone shares were down HK$0.02 at HK$0.64 in late morning.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
